1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Welcome to ROADGUARD AI — the next-generation smart-city platform for road damage intelligence and municipal maintenance triage.

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:16,500
Every year, billions are lost to road decay. Traditional inspections are slow, paper-bound, and leave hazardous potholes unattended.

3
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:25,500
ROADGUARD AI transforms this into an automated four-step intelligence pipeline: capture, detect, prioritize, and dispatch.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:37,500
Powered by Ultralytics YOLO, our computer vision engine scans road imagery in real time, localizing potholes and fissures with high-confidence bounding boxes.

5
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:49,500
Our explainable scoring engine calculates an objective 0 to 100 hazard index based on damaged surface area, defect density, and roadway traffic context.

6
00:00:50,200 --> 00:01:00,500
Every incident is mapped on an interactive GIS telemetry system with priority-coded markers, cluster analysis, and embedded photo evidence.

7
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:09,800
Municipal authorities triage a ranked queue, audit repair lifecycles, and generate official civil engineering PDF work orders with one click.

8
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:15,000
ROADGUARD AI: Building safer, smarter, data-driven municipal infrastructure.
